"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/9dd06a2c-70d5-4df1-b0c9-8fbd98f5f089.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":["kitchen"],"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/9dd06a2c-70d5-4df1-b0c9-8fbd98f5f089.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/9dd06a2c-70d5-4df1-b0c9-8fbd98f5f089.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/9dd06a2c-70d5-4df1-b0c9-8fbd98f5f089.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/9dd06a2c-70d5-4df1-b0c9-8fbd98f5f089.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/9dd06a2c-70d5-4df1-b0c9-8fbd98f5f089.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}},{"originalLink":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/f6fdc4a9-bf5f-4eae-b287-a81a490c72c1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","categories":null,"sizes":{"1024x768":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/f6fdc4a9-bf5f-4eae-b287-a81a490c72c1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=768&w=1024","width":1024,"height":768},"2048x1536":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/f6fdc4a9-bf5f-4eae-b287-a81a490c72c1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=1536&w=2048","width":2048,"height":1536},"320x240":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/f6fdc4a9-bf5f-4eae-b287-a81a490c72c1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/f6fdc4a9-bf5f-4eae-b287-a81a490c72c1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1632630/f6fdc4a9-bf5f-4eae-b287-a81a490c72c1.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"(hidden): Stil, Flair, Zentral & Naturnah \n Historic old town center meets a quiet location by the stream. Centrally located and ideal for couples. Welcome to your compact unit in the heart of Herdecke..\n.\n.\n# Welcome.\n.\nThis fully equipped 34 m2 ground-floor apartment is the perfect choice for guests seeking short distances and a functional layout:.\n.\n- For Couples & Solo Travelers: The separate bedroom with a King-size double bed offers high comfort for a relaxed stay..\n.\n- For Hospital Visitors & Students: Proximity to the Herdecke Community Hospital and the University of Witten/Herdecke makes this apartment a strategically ideal base..\n.\n- For Nature Lovers & Cyclists: Located between Lake Harkort and Lake Hengstey. The stream directly behind the house ensures a quiet atmosphere right in the center..\n.\n.\n# The Apartment.\n.\nThis 34 m2 ground-floor apartment offers an efficient and bright layout. The unit is ideally designed for two people: a separate bedroom with a King-size double bed and a Smart TV ensures privacy. The living-dining area with an integrated kitchen forms the functional center of the apartment..\n.\n.\n# Highlights.\n.\n- King-Size Comfort: A large double bed and a Smart TV in the separate bedroom..\n.\n- Top Location: Directly in the historic Herdecke old town – all important points are within walking distance..\n.\n- Quiet Backdrop: A stream runs directly behind the property, providing a pleasant atmosphere..\n.\n- Fully Equipped: Compact kitchen with a dishwasher and microwave for effortless self-catering..\n.\n.\n# Amenities.\n.\n- Living & Sleeping: Separate bedroom with King-size double bed and Smart TV. Living-dining area with seating..\n.\n- Kitchen & Household: The separate kitchen offers everything for self-catering: ceramic hob, refrigerator, dishwasher, and microwave. Coffee maker, toaster, and kettle are provided..\n.\n- Bath & Comfort: Functional bathroom with shower and hairdryer. Heating is provided by a reliable gas boiler..\n.\n- Internet: Stay connected with fast Wi-Fi throughout the apartment..\n.\n- Building & Access: Full temporal flexibility during check-in thanks to modern smart locks (code access)..\n.\n.\n# About the Surroundings.\n.\nYour strategic location: In the \"City between the Lakes,\" where Westphalian coziness meets modern infrastructure..\n.\n.\n# Location & Connectivity.\n.\n- Public Transport: Herdecke station (connections to Dortmund/Hagen) is reachable in approx. 6 minutes on foot (450 m)..\n.\n- Hospital Proximity: The Herdecke Community Hospital is approx. 2.5 km away (approx. 5 min by car)..\n.\n- Center: The marketplace with restaurants and shops is only approx. 500 m away..\n.\n- Nature: The Ruhr river and the promenade at Lake Harkort are reachable in approx. 15 minutes on foot..\n.\n.\n# Your Fast Path to Destinations:.\n.\n- Target: Herdecke Old Town / Center | Transport: Foot | Duration: approx. 5 minutes.\n.\n- Target: Herdecke Station | Transport: Foot | Duration: approx. 6 minutes.\n.\n- Target: Harkortsee Promenade | Transport: Foot / Bike | Duration: approx. 15 / 5 min..\n.\n- Target: Community Hospital | Transport: Car / Bus | Duration: approx. 5 / 10 min..\n.\n.\n# Shopping & Local Supplies.\n.\nEverything for daily needs is located in the city center: supermarkets, bakeries, and drugstores are reachable within 5 to 10 minutes on foot..\n.\n.\n# Gastronomy & Going Out.\n.\nHerdecke's old town offers diverse gastronomy. Whether traditional inns or modern cafes – numerous options are located within a radius of only 500 m..\n.\n.\n# Leisure & Recreation.\n.\nTake advantage of the location for outdoor activities:.\n.\n- Lake Harkort & Lake Hengstey: Ideal for hiking, running, or water sports..\n- Herdecke Viaduct: An impressive architectural monument in the immediate vicinity..\n- Ruhr Valley Cycle Path: Perfect for extensive bike tours along the river..\n.\n.\n# Host's Insider Tips.\n.\n- Tip 1 (View): A trip to the Koepchenwerk offers a spectacular view over the Ruhr Valley..\n.\n- Tip 2 (Idyll): The area around Bachplatz shows the old town at its best..\n.\n- Tip 3 (Culinary): Visit the small cafes in the pedestrian zone for homemade cakes..\n.\n- Tip 4 (Historical): The Herdecke local history museum offers exciting insights into the city's history..\n.\n- Tip 5 (Active): A canoe tour on the Ruhr offers a whole new perspective on the city..\n.\n.\n# Important Notes on Accommodation & Location.\n.\nThe apartment is located on the ground floor, offering easy access..\n.\nPlease note that the apartment does not have a washing machine or dryer. However, thanks to the central location, all services are reachable nearby. The 34 m2 are compact and functionally designed – ideal for guests seeking a central base..\n.\n---.\n.\nReady for your stay in Herdecke? Secure your (hidden) directly in the historic old town now!","facilities":{"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"1"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"no"},"smoking":{"value":"no"},"totalSize":{"value":"34"},"tv":{"value":"no"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":190000,"deposit":20000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1900.00","deposit":"200.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":0,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":1,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"2026-04-11","from":"2026-04-10"},{"to":"2026-05-02","from":"2026-04-25"},{"to":"2027-10-02","from":"2026-05-22"},{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2029-04-10"}],"updated":"2026-04-10T04:53:18Z","__utId__":"ut1632630"}]